  "id": "balsamic-beets",
  "name": "Balsamic Beets",
  "subtitle": "Tender shredded beets with tangy balsamic flavor",
  "description": "Shredded beets are gently cooked in butter and water, then finished with balsamic vinegar and simple seasoning.",
